<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on ABB.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on ABB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland said it</p>
<p>has issued 20</p>
<p>million American-style call warrants on bearer shares of ABB AG.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 50 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    2,200 CHF		 PREMIUM	14.0 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.18 CHF		  GEARING	18.5 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 04.JUN.97-17.JUL.98   PAYDATE	04.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2,023 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
